enrouter \u00b7 deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash\u001b[38;5;238m  \u00b7  \u001b[38;5;109mpinned by you\u001b[38;5;238m  \u00b7  \u001b[38;5;109mteam (shift+tab)\u001b[38;5;238m  \u00b7\r\n\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;5;245m/ commands \u00b7 @ files \u00b7 ctrl+f files \u00b7 ctrl+g graph \u00b7 ctrl+v image \u00b7 alt+enter newline \u00b7 ctrl+o"]
